{"id":"idkbqeYUg6","name":"Bitcoin","domain":"bitcoin.org","claimed":false,"description":"Bitcoin.org is dedicated to help Bitcoin to develop in a sustainable way.","longDescription":"Bitcoin.org is an independent and community-funded project dedicated to supporting the development of Bitcoin in a sustainable way. Originally registered and owned by Bitcoin's first two developers, Satoshi Nakamoto and Martti Malmi, the website is now managed by contributors from around the world. While the co-owners have the final publication authority, regular activity and updates are organized through a public pull request process. It's important to note that Bitcoin.org is not the official website of Bitcoin, as nobody owns the Bitcoin network. Bitcoin is controlled by its users globally, who freely choose the software they use. The mission of Bitcoin.org is to inform users about Bitcoin's properties, potential uses, and limitations, while providing a neutral and transparent resource. Contributions, support, and improvements from the community are greatly appreciated, and the website welcomes donations to help enhance its services.","links":[{"name":"youtube","url":"https://youtube.com/BitcoincomOfficial"},{"name":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/bitcoin"},{"name":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/bitcoin.org.site"},{"name":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/bitcoinorg"},{"name":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/theBitcoinorg"}],"logos":[{"theme":"dark","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idkbqeYUg6/theme/dark/symbol.svg?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transparent","format":"svg","height":88,"width":88,"size":1640},{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idkbqeYUg6/w/800/h/800/theme/dark/symbol.png?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transparent","format":"png","height":800,"width":800,"size":38637}],"tags":[],"type":"symbol"},{"theme":"light","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idkbqeYUg6/theme/light/lo